ack into that release  some videos that I'd shot on Kierkegaard  and released to my patreon supporters  earlier  I've been publicly releasing those some  Aristotle politics videos as well and  podcast episodes I did some podcast  episodes on Cicero's stoic paradoxes and  Epictetus discourses so that was the  month of September alright so what have  we got coming up in the month of October  it's going to be quite a busy month for  a lot of different reasons some of which  I'll talk about more in just a minute  and let's talk about events first so  tomorrow in the afternoon here in the  Milwaukee area that tomorrow that is  October 6th at 3:30 p.m. we have a  stoical week event I'll be talking on  stoic philosophy and the value of money  what role money can play in happiness or  in relation to the virtues or in  relation to our emotions I won't say too  much about that and I will hopefully get  a good video recording of that so I'll  post that online for those who aren't in  this area on Tuesday the 9th  I will be making another guest  appearance on the image for hire radio  show hosted by River West radio with our  host being the skräuss he and I will be  talking about HP Lovecraft  and probably will talk about August  Derleth as well since he played a major  role in the continuation and  dissemination of Lovecraft's works and  he was based here in Wisconsin on the  11th at the Brookfield public library  7:00 p.m. we continue our worlds of  speculative fiction series this time  looking at the Alliance Union universe  CGH era some really great books there  starting with down below station really  interesting stuff then on the 13th at 12  o'clock p.m. that Central Standard Time  I will be hosting the dr. Sandler asked  me anything that is am a session at the  same day at 2 o'clock I will be having  my philosophy chat for patreon  supporters on the 16th at 3 o'clock p.m.  will start shifting into Hagel gear with  our public Hagel Q&amp;A online session so  if you've got